{"4507060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vanguard Valiants", "steam_appid": 4507060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4942260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim</strong> the lands taken by the Zahar. Build and lead armies to recover the villages seized by the enemy. Acquire better weapons and manage your soldiers throughout the <strong>liberation campaign.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a medieval open world, gather soldiers, and lead battles to reclaim your people's lands. The enemies <strong>don’t stand still</strong>: they constantly advance, taking villages and expanding their control while you fight to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every battle changes the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in combat, <strong>you can return to the fight.</strong> Reorganize your troops, plan your next move, and keep fighting to restore the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear:<br><strong>Push the enemy army back and conquer the center of the map.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware…<br>If the enemies capture all the villages, the kingdom will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507060/extras/8dab3c4698d4e6a292039c2a78b34a0c.poster.avif?t=1785032639\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507060/extras/8dab3c4698d4e6a292039c2a78b34a0c.webm?t=1785032639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507060/extras/8dab3c4698d4e6a292039c2a78b34a0c.mp4?t=1785032639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_ga